# 🔙 1️⃣6️⃣ BACKTRACKING

Backtracking means:

> **Try a choice → Explore → Undo the choice → Try another choice.**

Think of it as:

```text
Choose
  ↓
Explore
  ↓
Undo
  ↓
Choose another
```

