# 2️⃣0️⃣ SUBSETS vs PERMUTATIONS

| Subsets               | Permutations          |
| --------------------- | --------------------- |
| Order doesn't matter  | Order matters         |
| Take/Don't Take       | Choose unused element |
| Usually `start` index | Usually `used[]`      |
