# 🧠 2️⃣7️⃣ YOUR UNIVERSAL DP TEMPLATE

When you're stuck on a DP question, write this:

```text
1. Define STATE
        ↓
2. Identify CHOICES
        ↓
3. Write TRANSITION
        ↓
4. Find BASE CASE
        ↓
5. Decide TOP-DOWN / BOTTOM-UP
        ↓
6. Optimize SPACE if possible
```

Example:

```text
House Robber

State:
dp[i] = max money until i

Choices:
Take / Don't Take

Transition:
max(dp[i-1], nums[i]+dp[i-2])

Base:
dp[0] = 0

Answer:
dp[n-1]
```

🔥 This is far more valuable than memorizing code.

